# Rolling picture: dry Joint at U10 pin 2 (1B, VSYNC_N from U38); it floats high, the composite sync is only
# HSYNC_N, and the TV runs its frames free. The paddles, triggered from TICK_N (line 308), work.
machine tennis
title "Rolling picture"
brief "The picture rolls up the screen and never holds still, though the game seems to play."
fault joint U10.2
